\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gDV-gx9_6YOn5JfwTHlnOUY7YWQA7uUR", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@torisenpai_art/works/89", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/326eb5dc/uploads/origins/7462748a-47f0-4678-aa85-82a329dc5da6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f3c0be718501918c5c94c4a219919ad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/326eb5dc/uploads/origins/7462748a-47f0-4678-aa85-82a329dc5da6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f3c0be718501918c5c94c4a219919ad, https://si.imgix.net/326eb5dc/uploads/origins/7462748a-47f0-4678-aa85-82a329dc5da6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ce45e5ce529aad181166b828f043b7b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/326eb5dc/uploads/origins/7462748a-47f0-4678-aa85-82a329dc5da6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74f8f296a64b67b5945c99b506b8f4d4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nこの大空に、翼をひろげて」の望月天音のイラストをお願いします。緑のトップスにジーンズというカジュアルな格好でお願いします。ポーズや表情にこだわりはありません。よろしくお願いします。\n\nキャラクターの説明\nあまねは、とても野心的なプロジェクトを完成させるために、あえて高校最終学年を何度も繰り返している大人です。アマネは信じられないほど頭がいい。特に科学と数学が得意だ。しかし、勉強以外の面では、アマネは常識がほとんどない、かなり空気の読めない子だ。たいていの人は、アマネの知性に恐れおののき、近寄りがたいと感じる。しかし、実際はとても親切で人懐っこい。\n\n参考：https://imgur.com/a/amane-mochizuki-o8SUQX0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@torisenpai_art/works/88", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/47c4314b/uploads/origins/e6014992-4df3-4039-9968-6e4d8c46ff2e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d72f4ba79b71f53ff9b7f549a2bc8312", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/47c4314b/uploads/origins/e6014992-4df3-4039-9968-6e4d8c46ff2e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d72f4ba79b71f53ff9b7f549a2bc8312, https://si.imgix.net/47c4314b/uploads/origins/e6014992-4df3-4039-9968-6e4d8c46ff2e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=733b4997175f4752f74f69db0931be9e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/47c4314b/uploads/origins/e6014992-4df3-4039-9968-6e4d8c46ff2e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f3ea619ecd4d6f71ec3c9281ef0c77e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello sensei! I really love your art style! I’d like to request a drawing of my vtuber character. She’s a nine-tailed fox maid who lives in a fantasy European-style mansion. She has fluffy large ears and tails. Her personality is soft, spacey and clumsy. She often spills her tea and she loves her black cat.\n\nImportant: Please make sure to include all her hair color, which is light pink, white and black. Her bangs, both side of her front hair are white color, not pink. And the inner back part of her hair is also white color. Full details are in the folder.\n-This is not necessary, please separate her tails in a different layer if possible.\n-You can draw multiple tails or just one tail.\n-Her eye color is light mint color.\n\nCould you please draw her facial expression similar to this with a sexy feminine pose? I would like to use it for future ASMR. I would be grateful if you could separate the character and the background in psd format. Thank you so much for the consideration!\nhttps://skeb.jp/@torisenpai_art/works/75\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12oYDPCvbXHwu_Dn_31z_21EyONcVSq7f", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@torisenpai_art/works/87", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7cf6c45e/uploads/origins/e143b25f-6fb0-4da1-bdf7-e84a04f76dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec9dcae3004788d69aefc830a9f96db5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7cf6c45e/uploads/origins/e143b25f-6fb0-4da1-bdf7-e84a04f76dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec9dcae3004788d69aefc830a9f96db5, https://si.imgix.net/7cf6c45e/uploads/origins/e143b25f-6fb0-4da1-bdf7-e84a04f76dd0?bg=%23fff&au